test "rank348: Ceilometer logs parsed polling config at info level"
  lang python
  expect VYQL-SEC-007
  expect_review code.SensitiveConfigInfoLog
  code
  ```
  import yaml

  class ConfigManagerBase(object):
      def load_config(self, cfg_file):
          with open(cfg_file) as fap:
              conf = yaml.safe_load(fap)
          LOG.info("Config file: %s", conf)
          return conf
  ```

